1
00:00:02,236 --> 00:00:04,466
SHELDON: I'm glad to see
you made it safely.

2
00:00:04,471 --> 00:00:05,901
(Sheldon:)How's your hotel?

3
00:00:05,906 --> 00:00:09,146
(Amy(on Skype):)It's not the best Best Western
I've been to,

4
00:00:09,143 --> 00:00:10,873
(Amy(on Skype):)but I'd say it's...

5
00:00:10,878 --> 00:00:13,878
(Amy(on Skype):)the third best Best Western
I've been to.

6
00:00:13,881 --> 00:00:15,511
(Sheldon:)I know how you feel.

7
00:00:15,516 --> 00:00:19,516
(Sheldon:)The Best Buy by my house
is only the third best Best Buy.

8
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:21,250
(Sheldon:)They have
the best buys,

9
00:00:21,255 --> 00:00:23,985
(Sheldon:)but having the best buys
isn't the only thing

10
00:00:23,991 --> 00:00:27,291
(Sheldon:)that makes a Best Buy
the best Best Buy.

11
00:00:28,329 --> 00:00:32,029
(Amy:)What makes a best Best Buy
the best Best Buy?

12
00:00:32,032 --> 00:00:33,332
(Sheldon:)Mm, that's a great question.

13
00:00:33,334 --> 00:00:35,904
(Sheldon:)I like when they're
next to a Chipotle.

14
00:00:37,037 --> 00:00:39,737
(Amy:)Okay, well, I should unpack.

15
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:40,710
(Sheldon:)All right.

16
00:00:40,708 --> 00:00:42,608
(Sheldon:)Enjoy the neurobiology
conference.

17
00:00:42,610 --> 00:00:43,780
(Amy:)I will.

18
00:00:43,777 --> 00:00:46,377
(Amy:)I... wish you were here.

19
00:00:46,380 --> 00:00:48,380
(Sheldon:)At a neurobiology conference?

20
00:00:48,382 --> 00:00:50,552
(Sheldon:)What a mean thing to say.

21
00:00:51,585 --> 00:00:55,155
Okay, I'm glad you're not here?

22
00:00:55,155 --> 00:00:57,155
(Sheldon:)Aw, you always know
just what to say

23
00:00:57,157 --> 00:00:59,257
(Sheldon:)after I tell you what to say.

24
00:00:59,260 --> 00:01:01,730
(Amy:)Good-bye, Sheldon.

